      ],
      "source": "https://winstonvillecf.org/history/",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During the 1950s and 1960s Winstonville felt the ripple of the Civil Rights Movement across the Delta.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://winstonvillecf.org/history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Cotton has long dominated Winstonville’s economy, with fertile Delta soil supporting extensive farming and sharecropping.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25,
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://winstonvillecf.org/history/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Despite hardships, Winstonville’s close‑knit community keeps history and resilience at the heart of its identity.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
